WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.643
- I bind because it kind of

00:00:02.643 --> 00:00:04.735
quiets that dysphoria that I get.

00:00:04.735 --> 00:00:08.806
I bind because it makes me
feel safer when I'm outside.

00:00:09.758 --> 00:00:13.105
I bind because I think I look a lot hotter

00:00:13.105 --> 00:00:14.769
when I'm in a binder than when I'm not.

00:00:14.769 --> 00:00:16.817
(slow music)

00:00:16.817 --> 00:00:18.673
- I started binding about a year ago.

00:00:18.673 --> 00:00:19.722
- Two years.

00:00:19.722 --> 00:00:21.130
- Maybe eight months ago.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.110
- Six years.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:26.140
- I first started binding when
I was a teenager in college.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.025
- Almost five and half
years I binded, straight.

00:00:29.025 --> 00:00:33.574
(slow music)

00:00:33.574 --> 00:00:35.409
- You kind of just wear it like a tank top

00:00:35.409 --> 00:00:38.287
and, you know, it just
totally flattens your chest.

00:00:38.287 --> 00:00:40.251
- I think I had like
double D's and I would

00:00:40.251 --> 00:00:42.386
put on the binder and it
would probably go down

00:00:42.386 --> 00:00:44.370
two sizes just because it's so tight

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:46.651
and it's like a suction cup almost.

00:00:46.651 --> 00:00:49.451
It's just holding
everything tightly together.

00:00:49.451 --> 00:00:51.159
- So, this is the one that I got during

00:00:51.159 --> 00:00:54.167
my freshman year (laughs) of college.

00:00:54.167 --> 00:00:57.493
You can see it's very,
very, very stretched out

00:00:57.493 --> 00:01:00.161
and like, you can see through it.

00:01:00.161 --> 00:01:03.189
- I'm not sure how this hole
happened, but it's there.

00:01:03.189 --> 00:01:05.153
- I like to be androgynous,

00:01:05.153 --> 00:01:06.945
so I feel like this helps me achieve that.

00:01:06.945 --> 00:01:08.801
- I don't know, I was
just really uncomfortable

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:12.629
in T-shirts and I wear
a lot of button shirts.

00:01:12.629 --> 00:01:15.238
- Pretty open about it 'cause
I complain about it a lot.

00:01:15.238 --> 00:01:17.542
I also have friends who
are in the same situation

00:01:17.542 --> 00:01:19.869
where they also can't afford top surgery.

00:01:19.869 --> 00:01:24.840
(slow music)

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:27.188
- It allowed me to go
out into public with,

00:01:27.188 --> 00:01:30.941
you know, a shirt on and
just be able to seen as a guy

00:01:30.941 --> 00:01:33.608
because, you know, it
was before top surgery.

00:01:33.608 --> 00:01:36.084
- If I didn't have my
binder, I couldn't function.

00:01:36.084 --> 00:01:39.645
I just couldn't go out, I
couldn't have dinner with friends.

00:01:39.645 --> 00:01:43.124
I couldn't talk to family
because I wasn't the Renee,

00:01:43.124 --> 00:01:46.388
the whole Renee or as
closest to the whole Renee

00:01:46.388 --> 00:01:48.285
I could be without my binder with me.

00:01:48.285 --> 00:01:50.932
- I've had dysphoria
from, with my breasts,

00:01:50.932 --> 00:01:52.668
since they grew in.

00:01:52.668 --> 00:01:55.508
I tried to use regular
tape to tape 'em down,

00:01:55.508 --> 00:01:56.895
so I was like what's happening?

00:01:56.895 --> 00:01:59.092
What is this little knot in my chest?

00:01:59.092 --> 00:02:01.501
- I have a lot of fear of,
you know, getting assaulted

00:02:01.501 --> 00:02:04.276
or just being stared at in public

00:02:04.276 --> 00:02:07.069
'cause I definitely don't
like to leave my apartment

00:02:07.069 --> 00:02:08.436
without my binder even to go to

00:02:08.436 --> 00:02:10.739
the corner store to buy a cup of coffee.

00:02:10.739 --> 00:02:13.279
- When you put it on
and it's what you want

00:02:13.279 --> 00:02:16.735
and what you need, it's
the most euphoric feeling.

00:02:16.735 --> 00:02:19.080
You're like, "Yes, I'm complete."

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.619
- And seeing kind of a
silhouette that looks right

00:02:21.619 --> 00:02:24.735
instead of these weird
lumps in front of me.

00:02:25.575 --> 00:02:27.943
- They tell you to bind
correctly or it'll hurt,

00:02:27.943 --> 00:02:30.674
but I feel like binding just
doesn't feel good at all.

00:02:30.674 --> 00:02:32.978
- It was 77 degrees yesterday in New York

00:02:32.978 --> 00:02:37.566
and I was just, sweat
was pouring down my body.

00:02:37.566 --> 00:02:40.830
- (sighs) It feels really
good to take it off.

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:42.535
- When people think about binding,

00:02:42.535 --> 00:02:44.562
they might think it's very constricting,

00:02:44.562 --> 00:02:47.058
something that's painful,
why would you wanna do that

00:02:47.058 --> 00:02:49.874
to your body, but it's just a way

00:02:49.874 --> 00:02:52.478
to kind of connect our mind to our body.

00:02:52.478 --> 00:02:57.106
- I didn't want to look like
or feel like I had breasts.

00:02:57.958 --> 00:02:59.986
Even though binding does help give

00:02:59.986 --> 00:03:02.011
that appearance that they are gone,

00:03:02.011 --> 00:03:04.678
it is a strong reminder
that they are there.

00:03:04.678 --> 00:03:06.642
- Sometimes you're
gonna put that binder on

00:03:06.642 --> 00:03:09.734
and it's not going to
change anything for you

00:03:09.734 --> 00:03:12.571
and it's okay to have those moments.

00:03:12.571 --> 00:03:14.386
- There's not a lot of discussions,

00:03:14.386 --> 00:03:16.946
especially outside of the
trans community about binding

00:03:16.946 --> 00:03:19.462
and I think that more
people should talk about it

00:03:19.462 --> 00:03:21.958
and we should be allowed
to be more open about it

00:03:21.958 --> 00:03:24.475
and feel more free
having these discussions.

00:03:24.475 --> 00:03:28.982
(peaceful music)

